WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.534 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Let's get to
some news here, guys.

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.335 line:92%
I heard that President Trump

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:06.072 align:start size:94% position:6%
wants to fire his
chief of staff, John Kelly.

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:06.773 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Yeah, Kelly was shocked.

00:00:06.773 --> 00:00:08.908 align:start size:94% position:6%
He was like, "Wait, I haven't
already been fired?

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:12.178 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, what's --
I still work here?"

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:13.079 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:15.015 size:88% position:44%
There are also reports
that Trump wants to fire

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:18.451
his Homeland Security secretary,
Kirstjen Nielsen.

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:19.319 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience oohs ]

00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:21.688 align:start size:94% position:6%
When asked who he liked to run
Homeland Security,

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:23.256 line:92%
Trump said, "Claire Danes.

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:27.293 align:start size:94% position:6%
She'd be perfect,
absolutely perfect."

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:29.295 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Some more news here.

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:32.966
Today, Trump took part in
a ceremony to celebrate Diwali,

00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:35.101 line:92%
the Hindu festival of lights.

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:35.635 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
But at the event,

00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:37.937 align:start size:94% position:6%
Trump had a little trouble
lighting a candle.

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:38.705 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Watch this.

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:41.174 line:92%
[ Camera shutters clicking ]

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:46.613 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.252 --> 00:00:56.456 align:start size:94% position:6%
Trump was like -- He's like,
"I got to be careful.

00:00:56.456 --> 00:00:57.924 align:start size:94% position:6%
If this gets
anywhere near my hair,

00:00:57.924 --> 00:01:00.527 align:start size:94% position:6%
the whole place
is going to blow.

00:01:00.527 --> 00:01:03.530 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Someone else do this."

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:03.963 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Fwoo!

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:07.500
But since Diwali is India's
biggest holiday of the year,

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:08.735 line:92%
Trump decided to release a video

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:11.638
wishing a happy Diwali
to several Indian cities.

00:01:11.638 --> 00:01:12.439 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Here, check this out.

00:01:12.439 --> 00:01:14.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ As President Trump ]
I want to wish a happy Divali

00:01:14.474 --> 00:01:16.242 line:92%
to all the cities in India.

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:19.212 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Cities like Del-hi.

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:20.413 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:21.948 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Coca-Cola.

00:01:21.948 --> 00:01:24.551 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Mambo No. 5.

00:01:24.551 --> 00:01:26.786 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Victoria Beckham.

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:28.188 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Bang Al Gore.

00:01:28.188 --> 00:01:31.357 align:start size:94% position:6%
And my personal favorite,
Spider-Man.

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:32.459 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:32.459 --> 00:01:34.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Normal voice ] He's trying.
I don't know.

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:36.463 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Come on.

00:01:36.463 --> 00:01:38.798 size:88% position:44% line:92%
He don't know no better.

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:39.599 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Here's a big story.

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:43.903
This morning, CNN filed a
lawsuit against President Trump.

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:45.939 line:92%
When he found out, Trump was --

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:46.940 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:48.274 align:start size:94% position:6%
When he found out,
Trump was furious.

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:50.910 align:start size:94% position:6%
He was like, "Crap,
did I sleep with CNN?"

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:51.911 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I thought we --

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:54.013 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:54.013 --> 00:01:56.916 size:84% position:42%
That's right, CNN filed
a lawsuit against Trump

00:01:56.916 --> 00:01:59.819 size:88% position:44%
for taking away reporter
Jim Acosta's press pass.

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:02.155 align:start size:94% position:6%
But this isn't the first time
the White House

00:02:02.155 --> 00:02:03.556 align:start size:94% position:6%
has had trouble
with a press pass.

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:05.225 align:start size:94% position:6%
Listen to this.
I saw this on the news today.

00:02:05.225 --> 00:02:09.362
-There have been sort of notable
problems with that process,

00:02:09.362 --> 00:02:11.164 align:start size:94% position:6%
including in
the Bush administration

00:02:11.164 --> 00:02:14.367 align:start size:94% position:6%
when they gave a --
regularly, gave a day pass

00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:18.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
to someone who turned out
to be a male escort.

00:02:18.204 --> 00:02:21.307 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.242 --> 00:02:24.978
-They knew something was up
when he was the only reporter

00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:27.614 align:start size:94% position:6%
wearing tear-away pants
and a dog collar.

00:02:27.614 --> 00:02:29.749 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:33.019 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Who's that guy?
What network's he with?"

00:02:33.019 --> 00:02:33.686 size:75% position:38% line:92%
This is pretty cool.

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:36.356 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's a new pose
everyone's doing online

00:02:36.356 --> 00:02:37.957 size:81% position:41% line:92%
called the Instasplit.

00:02:37.957 --> 00:02:38.758 line:92%
You guys heard about this?

00:02:38.758 --> 00:02:40.360 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here's Victoria Beckham
doing it.

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:41.961 align:start size:94% position:6%
And here's Katy Perry.
She did it.

00:02:41.961 --> 00:02:44.564 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Kate Beckinsale did it,
yeah.

00:02:44.564 --> 00:02:45.965 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Pretty impressive.

00:02:45.965 --> 00:02:48.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
Higgins, why don't you
give it a try?

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:50.436 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Sure.

00:02:50.436 --> 00:02:52.872 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:58.344 --> 00:03:01.948 align:start size:94% position:6%
-James, do you want
to give it a go?

00:03:01.948 --> 00:03:03.116 line:92%
-Don't think I can do that.

00:03:03.116 --> 00:03:05.518 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Ah, come on,
just try it, buddy.

00:03:05.518 --> 00:03:08.254 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Fine.

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:08.821 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Grunts ]

00:03:08.821 --> 00:03:10.723 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, yeah, hey.

00:03:10.723 --> 00:03:12.525 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh, my God. Oh.

00:03:12.525 --> 00:03:15.094 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.336 align:start size:94% position:6%
How's he still
playing the piano?

00:03:23.336 --> 00:03:24.604 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I have no idea.

00:03:24.604 --> 00:03:26.339 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Grunts ]

00:03:26.339 --> 00:03:27.373 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-My God.

00:03:27.373 --> 00:03:30.276 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey, I heard today
is World Kindness Day.

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:32.745 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:32.745 --> 00:03:35.348
There's been a lot of negativity
in the world recently.

00:03:35.348 --> 00:03:36.816 align:start size:94% position:6%
So in honor
of World Kindness Day,

00:03:36.816 --> 00:03:38.751 align:start size:94% position:6%
I thought it would be good
if we went around

00:03:38.751 --> 00:03:41.120 align:start size:94% position:6%
