about each other.

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:42.388 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'll go first.

00:03:42.388 --> 00:03:44.724 align:start size:94% position:6%
Tariq, we've known each other
for a few years.

00:03:44.724 --> 00:03:48.561
And I have to say, not only are
you a really talented person,

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:53.533 align:start size:94% position:6%
you're also
a really great friend.

00:03:53.533 --> 00:03:57.337 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Cool.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:57.337 --> 00:04:00.773 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Okay, it's your turn.

00:04:00.773 --> 00:04:03.042 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thanks, Jimmy.
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:03.042 --> 00:04:04.877 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, you could
say something.

00:04:04.877 --> 00:04:06.546 align:start size:94% position:6%
You could say something now,
if you want.

00:04:06.546 --> 00:04:08.715 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I did.
Thanks.

00:04:08.715 --> 00:04:10.850 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.385 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-That's it?

00:04:12.385 --> 00:04:14.687 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:04:14.687 --> 00:04:16.656 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-Nothing else to add?

00:04:16.656 --> 00:04:19.058 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Um, okay.

00:04:19.058 --> 00:04:19.959 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Nice tie.

00:04:19.959 --> 00:04:21.961 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:21.961 --> 00:04:24.831 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's it?
-Yeah.

00:04:24.831 --> 00:04:26.432 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Just that?

00:04:26.432 --> 00:04:28.334 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Nothing else?

00:04:28.334 --> 00:04:29.502 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, I'm good.

00:04:29.502 --> 00:04:31.304 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:31.304 --> 00:04:35.975 size:75% position:38%
-Okay, well, I meant
everything I said.

00:04:35.975 --> 00:04:36.876 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Cool.

00:04:36.876 --> 00:04:38.878 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:38.878 --> 00:04:41.514 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Nothing?
You have nothing else to say?

00:04:41.514 --> 00:04:44.484 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-I mean, let me think.

00:04:44.484 --> 00:04:45.351 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
No.

00:04:45.351 --> 00:04:47.220 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But we're in front
of all these people.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:50.123
And I'm sure they'd like to hear
some kindness right now.

00:04:50.123 --> 00:04:53.092 align:start size:94% position:6%
Right, guys?
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:55.028 --> 00:04:58.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think they want
to hear jokes.

00:04:58.364 --> 00:04:58.898 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-No, they don't!

00:04:58.898 --> 00:05:02.101 size:78% position:39%
They want to hear you
say something kind.

00:05:02.101 --> 00:05:03.102 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Fine.

00:05:03.102 --> 00:05:06.906 line:92%
Hey, James, I appreciate you.

00:05:06.906 --> 00:05:09.108 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, no, no.
Screw James.

00:05:09.108 --> 00:05:11.344 size:78% position:39% line:92%
I'm talking about me!

00:05:11.344 --> 00:05:12.578 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-What did I do?

00:05:12.578 --> 00:05:13.446 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:05:13.446 --> 00:05:15.982 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, Jimmy,
that wasn't very kind.

00:05:15.982 --> 00:05:17.116 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Eh, shut up.

00:05:17.116 --> 00:05:19.052 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You shut up.
-No, you shut up.

00:05:19.052 --> 00:05:20.653 line:92%
-I'll shut up when you shut up.

00:05:20.653 --> 00:05:21.854 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, you.
-No, you!

00:05:21.854 --> 00:05:23.956 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, you!
-No, you shut up!

00:05:23.956 --> 00:05:24.991 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-No, you shut up!

00:05:24.991 --> 00:05:29.062
-Happy World Kindness Day
from your friends at NBC.

00:05:29.062 --> 00:05:32.465 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:38.471 --> 00:05:39.639 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Wow.

00:05:39.639 --> 00:05:43.009 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm going for the Emmy,
you guys.

00:05:43.009 --> 00:05:43.910 line:92%
You guys hear about this?

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:46.779 size:84% position:42%
Mattel just came out
with a new Magic 8-Ball

00:05:46.779 --> 00:05:48.614 line:92%
called the Trump Magic 8-Ball.

00:05:48.614 --> 00:05:49.349 size:88% position:44% line:92%
It's like a Magic 8-Ball

00:05:49.349 --> 00:05:51.150 align:start size:94% position:6%
but with Trump
answering your questions.

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:53.586 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, good news is
we actually have one.

00:05:53.586 --> 00:05:55.588
And he's going to answer
your questions right now.

00:05:55.588 --> 00:05:57.523 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's time for
"Trump Magic 8-Ball."

00:05:57.523 --> 00:05:58.791 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here we go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:58.791 --> 00:06:01.661 line:92%
-♪♪ Trump Magic 8-Ball ♪♪

00:06:01.661 --> 00:06:03.396 size:88% position:44% line:92%
♪♪ Trump Magic 8-Ball ♪♪

00:06:03.396 --> 00:06:05.131 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Welcome to
"Trump Magic 8-Ball."

00:06:05.131 --> 00:06:08.801
This Magic 8-Ball is filled with
the wisdom of President Trump.

00:06:08.801 --> 00:06:11.471 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can ask it
any personal question you want

00:06:11.471 --> 00:06:13.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
as long as it's
a yes or no question.

00:06:13.673 --> 00:06:14.540 line:92%
Then you give it a shake.

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.642 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the President
of the United States

00:06:16.642 --> 00:06:18.211 line:92%
will answer your question.

00:06:18.211 --> 00:06:19.846 line:92%
Who wants to give it a try?

00:06:19.846 --> 00:06:21.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
Come on.
Anybody?

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:21.881 align:start size:94% position:6%
Come on.
Come on.

00:06:21.881 --> 00:06:23.249 align:start size:94% position:6%
There you go.
You, there you go.

00:06:23.249 --> 00:06:24.283 align:start size:94% position:6%
Stand up.
How you doing, buddy?

00:06:24.283 --> 00:06:25.818 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can take that.
How you doing?

00:06:25.818 --> 00:06:27.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
What's your name?
-Rasmus.

00:06:27.653 --> 00:06:28.287 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Rasmus?
-Yeah.

00:06:28.287 --> 00:06:30.323 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, welcome to the show,
Rasmus.

00:06:30.323 --> 00:06:31.257 line:92%
What is a personal question

00:06:31.257 --> 00:06:33.793 size:84% position:42%
