the Trump Magic 8-Ball?

00:06:33.793 --> 00:06:37.230 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Um, what do you eat
for breakfast?

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:38.231 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:06:38.231 --> 00:06:39.932 line:92%
Oh, is it the 8-Ball or him?

00:06:39.932 --> 00:06:41.734 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, no,
it's a yes or no answer.

00:06:41.734 --> 00:06:44.771 size:81% position:41%
So you could be like,
"Did I eat breakfast?"

00:06:44.771 --> 00:06:46.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
Or...
[ Laughter ]

00:06:46.672 --> 00:06:47.306 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Would you -- Yeah.

00:06:47.306 --> 00:06:49.876 align:start size:94% position:6%
Would you like to eat sausage
for breakfast?

00:06:49.876 --> 00:06:51.511 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Something like that.

00:06:51.511 --> 00:06:53.446 line:92%
The answer has to be yes or no.

00:06:53.446 --> 00:06:54.147 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay, okay.

00:06:54.147 --> 00:06:55.014 line:92%
Do you like English breakfast?

00:06:55.014 --> 00:06:57.850 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, there you go.
Do you like English breakfast?

00:06:57.850 --> 00:06:59.585 align:start size:94% position:6%
Let's hear what the President
has to say,

00:06:59.585 --> 00:07:02.321 line:92%
if you want to hear this.

00:07:02.321 --> 00:07:04.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, yeah, I guess.
Why not?

00:07:04.824 --> 00:07:06.993 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There you go.
Perfect, unbelievable.

00:07:06.993 --> 00:07:08.628 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you, Rasmus.
Appreciate it.

00:07:08.628 --> 00:07:10.530 align:start size:94% position:6%
Anyone else?
Yes. Hi.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:12.298 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Get over here.

00:07:14.133 --> 00:07:15.802 align:start size:94% position:6%
Take your time.
Take your time.

00:07:15.802 --> 00:07:16.736 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here you go. Hey.
-Hi.

00:07:16.736 --> 00:07:17.570 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How you doing?
-Big fan.

00:07:17.570 --> 00:07:19.338 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, I'm a fan of yours.
How you doing?

00:07:19.338 --> 00:07:20.606 align:start size:94% position:6%
What's your name?
-Anupama.

00:07:20.606 --> 00:07:22.074 line:92%
-Anupama, where you from?

00:07:22.074 --> 00:07:23.342 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Well, Jersey City.

00:07:23.342 --> 00:07:24.877 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey.
Jersey City.

00:07:24.877 --> 00:07:26.913
-I was born and raised in Nepal,
though.

00:07:26.913 --> 00:07:27.814 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is that right?
-Yeah.

00:07:27.814 --> 00:07:30.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, thank you for being
on the show tonight.

00:07:30.516 --> 00:07:32.118 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can ask any question
you want.

00:07:32.118 --> 00:07:33.386 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the Trump Magic 8-Ball
will answer.

00:07:33.386 --> 00:07:35.388 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you have -- What question
would you like to ask?

00:07:35.388 --> 00:07:36.522 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Can I take a second?
-Sure.

00:07:36.522 --> 00:07:37.990 align:start size:94% position:6%
